<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-23T22:26:01.508Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:26:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces fired across the border into southern Syria, killing a Syrian man with disabilities in the Daraa buffer zone and deploying rooftop snipers who opened fire in the south. Two Syrian security officers were killed in a raid on an ISIL cell near Damascus. Hundreds of Syrians protested repeated Israeli incursions while Syrian Christians faced heightened risk of killing or abduction. Jordanian and Syrian foreign ministers held expanded talks in Aqaba after attacks on churches in Jordan, and a US envoy noted that Syria's interim leader seeks Israel normalization. The war caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSC1nQXdzUDZqdGNJdUZhVm5yVlhmRzVGeFlNTk5Ubkc3VmJCV3FjaHdsSEVnRDIta2oxR3VpNWo2LURaYTF1dFBhOGdFbmZEYktoNmZ6cWxLaDM3ZER3M0xkazExTC1uMFRFc1lSUmk5bWNYYmNoQ3kzTXY3bThBaWNpbG9WMFlfVll3eGdtMTdNLUtSUnhINFFkOV9qdkV4UWZmTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFByX3hUSmJucGdmRFU0SlB0QVMxRElTeVotWVJKTGNUcEMwbHZHMzZobklOTTdBVGtiT2s1Z1BCOUtRRDJpbEFEMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/two-syrian-security-officers-killed-in-raid-on-isil-cell-near-damascus&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQOFpnREFHTlZkLVlGZFM1NnE0N295cU5uV2hEOENQZ2lPbWhxYVBSUmtFelllY0ZJM1VaSWxvWWlPSFF0cFBvSzVOangzTm5ISWYzMUdOQVlPUTRlYTEyTi11R0h6MzFYTlg4aDQ3VGZlT212aFgxQVBBTnlJSmw4bXdNWndpWlhISUs0R1g0ZGZMNGhXelFPb2xPcHZaNXFX?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE0yZkt1Z0ZSdXljSUt6RzRsOGNickVjaDAxNVhFSXZITkMtNkRWaTBXSzhuRFFKUVdP